This documentation explains how the Katalon project integrates with Jira to publish automated execution results, create or reuse Test Plans, update Test Executions, generate the custom GAIA HTML report, and upload execution attachments.

The objective is to make the integration easier to understand, maintain, and evolve.



With this documentation, any maintainer should be able to:
Understand the end to end integration flow
Identify which class is responsible for each part of the process
Know where to change a specific rule
Understand which Jira endpoints are currently active


